flowchart TD
    ticket[New ticket] --> kind{What kind?}
    kind -->|Bug| repro{Can reproduce?}
    kind -->|Question| docs[Link to docs]
    kind -->|Feature request| backlog[Add to backlog]
    kind -->|Billing| finance[Hand to finance]
    repro -->|yes| issue[Open issue]
    repro -->|no| more[Ask for details]
    more --> repro
    issue --> fixed[Fixed in release]
    docs --> close([Close ticket])
    backlog --> close
    finance --> close
    fixed --> close
